OL,3,GNEWSAJCB to operate under joint
OL,4,Achairmanship
OL,5,
OL,6,FDigger manufacturer JCB is to operate
OL,7,Funder a joint chairmanship, with George
OL,8,FBamford taking on the role alongside
OL,9,Fhis father, incumbent chairman Lord
OL,10,FBamford.
OL,12,FGeorge Bamford, who founded watch brand
OL,13,FBamford Watch Department, will take the
OL,14,Frole from the start of October.
OL,16,FIt comes as Staffordshire-based JCB,
OL,17,Fwhich is due to open a new factory in
OL,18,FTexas next month, accelerates
OL,19,Finvestment in the UK and US.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
